sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Gate Admin
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (eu-ee31)
    participant Auth as Auth (API Key)
    participant PlatformReg as PlatformRegistry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>+Gate: POST /api/v1/platforms
    Note over Admin,Gate: Authorization: Bearer admin-key<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Body: {"id":"plt-abc-001","baseUrl":"https://efti.abc-logistics.ee","supportsSubsetting":true}

    Gate->>+Auth: Validate API key
    Auth-->>-Gate: User{isAdmin=true, role=ADMIN}

    Gate->>Gate: Deserialize Platform object

    Gate->>+PlatformReg: save(Platform{id="plt-abc-001", ...})
    PlatformReg->>+DB: INSERT INTO platforms<br/>(id, base_url, supports_subsetting, is_active, created_by, created_at)<br/>VALUES ('plt-abc-001', 'https://efti.abc-logistics.ee', TRUE,<br/>TRUE, $admin_uid, NOW())<br/>(append-only — re-saves are new rows; latest wins)
    DB-->>-PlatformReg: OK
    PlatformReg-->>-Gate: saved

    Gate-->>-Admin: 200 OK\n{"id":"plt-abc-001","baseUrl":"https://efti.abc-logistics.ee","supportsSubsetting":true,"createdAt":"2026-04-22T10:15:30Z"}

    Note over Admin: Platform registered. Admin must now create<br/>a platform user for the platform operator.

    Admin->>+Gate: POST /api/v1/users?generateSecret=true
    Note over Admin,Gate: Body: {"name":"ABC Logistics Operator","email":"operator@abc-logistics.ee","roles":{"PLATFORM":["plt-abc-001"]}}

    Gate->>Gate: Generate random UUID password
    Gate->>+DB: INSERT INTO users<br/>(id, email, name, roles, secret_hash, is_active, created_by, created_at)<br/>VALUES (uuid_generate_v4(), 'operator@abc-logistics.ee',<br/>'ABC Logistics Operator', '{"PLATFORM":["plt-abc-001"]}',<br/>bcrypt(...), TRUE, $admin_uid, NOW())
    DB-->>-Gate: user.id="c1d2e3f4-..."

    Gate-->>-Admin: 200 OK\nc1d2e3f4-...:generated-secret-uuid

    Note over Admin: Admin sends credentials to platform operator:<br/>email: operator@abc-logistics.ee<br/>secret: generated-secret-uuid
